// Affects: Required archive filenames, exact SHA-256 byte fingerprints, and optional capture-evidence lookup for selected dependencies; it does not certify a game platform or mark in-game tests passed.
// Reference: custom-pieces/docs/BUILD_AND_INSTALL.md explains dependency auditing and optional captures, and custom-pieces/docs/RELEASE.md describes re-auditing after NAM changes.
